{'symbol': 'BKNG', 'date': '2022-03-04 12:43:00', 'title': 'BOOKING HOLDINGS TO ATTEND THE BANK OF AMERICA MERRILL LYNCH 2022 SECURITIES CONSUMER & RETAIL TECHNOLOGY CONFERENCE', 'text': 'NORWALK, CONN., MARCH 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BOOKING HOLDINGS (NASDAQ: BKNG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER GLENN FOGEL AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER DAVID GOULDEN WILL BE SPEAKING AT THE BANK OF AMERICA MERRILL LYNCH 2022 CONSUMER & RETAIL TECHNOLOGY CONFERENCE ON MARCH 8TH AT 1:50 PM ET.'}